<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_5da646a8-09ff-4121-a0aa-0046ecadada7"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown" refid="act-1996-074"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Hawkesbury
Racecourse Act 1996</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0bbca674-9d5b-47d1-a239-768e3dda99f6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_3d4ed61e-7914-47b7-8581-0972c313c9bc"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day to be appointed by
proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9620f3ec-c203-47f0-8d03-39c0ee283d49"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_a254ea54-775e-4ee2-8f0b-6a7a520e65e1"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1643691d-4bd2-4a75-9f09-98f14242a0a8"
id="def.assets"><b><i>assets</i></b></defterm> means any legal or equitable
estates or interests (whether present or future and whether vested or
contingent) in real or personal property of any description (including money),
and includes securities, choses in action and documents.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_2d553d13-9519-4c27-812e-6234f799c1b2"
id="def.HawkesburyRacecourse"><b><i>Hawkesbury Racecourse</i></b></defterm>
means the land described in Schedule 1.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_0332f6d1-dc70-4f53-a4f9-367ab8bc4a2a"
id="def.liabilities"><b><i>liabilities</i></b></defterm> means any
liabilities, debts or obligations (whether present or future and whether
vested or contingent).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_d3eb754d-bafe-44b5-a4af-2c4f4e31241a"
id="def.rights"><b><i>rights</i></b></defterm> means all rights, powers,
privileges and immunities (whether present or future and whether vested or
contingent).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_fee90410-492d-4f45-a014-c6f86eae1980" id="def.theformerclub"><b><i>the
former club</i></b></defterm> means the members of the unincorporated body
known as the Hawkesbury Race Club.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_27bfe7d4-23a0-470e-b3c3-94861f125358"
id="def.theformertrustee"><b><i>the former trustee</i></b></defterm>, in
relation to the Hawkesbury Racecourse, means the trustee for the Racecourse
holding office under Division 4 of Part 5 of the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1989-006"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown
Lands Act 1989</i></name></legref> immediately before the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b2d65b1c-315a-4396-8c09-5d547bd9117c"
id="def.theincorporatedclub"><b><i>the incorporated club</i></b></defterm>
means the body corporate declared by the Minister under this Act to be the
incorporated Hawkesbury Race Club.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_38010700-6010-4028-8c61-6264429c3b13"
id="def.thereservetrust"><b><i>the reserve trust</i></b></defterm> means the
reserve trust referred to in section 5.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
